  "description": "As we say farewell to our beloved True Grit, we could not be prouder of its achievements.\n\nThe True Grit is not just a bike to us; it is a symbol of innovation and progress. It is the bike that transformed Lauf into a bike company on the global stage, and it is a bike that has taken countless riders to adventures and podiums the world over. It is a testament of our commitment to providing the best cycling experience possible. It was designed with durability, efficiency, and performance in mind. We believe it served its purpose well.\n\nMany of you have formed a deep connection with Lauf through the True Grit. This we are extremely thankful for. The success of the True Grit enabled us to keep at it and keep innovating. Hence, our next generation gravel bike, Seigla, was born.\n\nWe remain committed to providing you with the best cycling experience possible and we will continue to innovate and push boundaries in the cycling industry.\n\nThank you for being a part of the Lauf family. Cheers to many more happy days on the trails.\n\nSincerely,\n\nThe Lauf Team",
